### 1. Create a draft
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/spacefarer/Spacefarers
Authorization: Basic alice:alice
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Nova Stark", "email": "nova@example.com", "stardustCollection": 50, "wormholeNavigationSkill": 5 }

### 2. Activate the draft (copy the ID from the previous response)
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/spacefarer/Spacefarers(ID=$ID,IsActiveEntity=false)/SpacefarerService.draftActivate
Authorization: Basic alice:alice
Content-Type: application/json

{}
